OL,3,AMichael Sheen says Wales should be
OL,4,Aasked if it wants the Prince of Wales
OL,5,Atitle back
OL,6,
OL,7,FWelsh people should be asked whether
OL,8,Fthey want to take the Prince of Wales
OL,9,Ftitle back when it next becomes vacant,
OL,10,Fbelieves Michael Sheen.
OL,12,FThe actor said the title, currently
OL,13,Fheld by Prince William, "symbolises
OL,14,Fsomething that was essentially a
OL,15,Fput-down to Wales".
OL,17,F"Obviously that was a long, long time
OL,18,Fago, but these things have power
OL,19,Fstill," he added.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
