OL,3,AMichael Sheen says Wales should be
OL,4,Aasked if it wants the Prince of Wales
OL,5,Atitle back
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Hollywood actor was speaking ahead
OL,8,Fof his forthcoming portrayal of Owain
OL,9,FGlyndE5r, the last Welsh-born Prince of
OL,10,FWales, in a new theatre production at
OL,11,Fthe Wales Millennium Centre in Cardiff.
